@page "/"

<PageTitle>Live Ops Dashboard</PageTitle>

<h1>Live Ops Dashboard - Demo 2</h1>

<p>
    This demo shows Blazor Server + SignalR + reusable Razor components working together:
    a background service simulates system metrics, pushes them over a SignalR hub, and the
    dashboard page renders them live using components from the <code>SharedComponents</code>
    Razor Class Library.
</p>

<ul>
    <li><a href="dashboard">Live Dashboard</a> - real-time metric cards and event feed.</li>
    <li><a href="settings">Settings</a> - change the broadcast refresh interval (validated form).</li>
</ul>
